{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026QtrWosnZnX1793144763.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>來自加拿大的摩莉卡臣成為全球首位在15米高獨立浮冰上，完成後躍跳水的女性。</p><p></p><p>懸崖跳水世界系列賽總亞軍摩莉卡臣，在六月完成一項新挑戰，跳水的地點由懸崖變成冰山。為應對冰山環境的種種變數，她需要接受幾個月的訓練，包括攀冰技術、潛水衣測試和冷水適應等。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_JS.DIVE.EXTREME-0300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Sg84V61nll1793144749.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>冰山會隨海浪及天氣移動，因此在挑戰開始前已經有幾位專家進行周詳部署。這座冰山位於加拿大對開海域，摩莉卡臣先攀上冰山頂部，站在約15米高的獨立浮冰上後躍跳水，順利完成挑戰。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_JS.DIVE.EXTREME-0300_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026CwJ4PRk8jf1793144760.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>她表示一直都有這個夢想，但勇敢不代表消除恐懼。今次就是要測試自己能突破到甚麼程度。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_JS.DIVE.EXTREME-0300_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026n3uY9gzlm71793144743.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T01:01:30.811455+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":251,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T23:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T03:38:12.758768+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T00:58:34.000693+00:00","content_hash":"161289894487a474d480778dad31ea4737f0107cdddc686bde6bfa2882ba8229","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T01:01:30.811455+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}